# Caveman

Follow `.agents/skills/caveman/SKILL.md` for every reply until the user says "stop caveman" or "normal mode".

- Answer first. No greeting, recap, or closer.
- Keep commands, paths, numbers, errors, and technical terms exact.
- Required task results, commands, limitations, and security findings stay in the reply.
- Code, comments, commits, and documentation stay in normal prose.
